# Deno Configuration

Sigma-anchored configuration for the Deno runtime.

@[json]
```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": [
      "deno.ns",
      "dom"
    ],
    "strict": true
  },
  "imports": {
    "@/": "./TS/"
  },
  "lint": {
    "rules": {
      "tags": [
        "recommended"
      ]
    }
  },
  "fmt": {
    "useTabs": false,
    "lineWidth": 80,
    "indentWidth": 2,
    "singleQuote": false
  }
}
```
